(Slide 25: GRAMMAR + | Present Simple: Positive Sentences ? | The Rule | Subject (I / You / We) Tj
T*
(/ They) + Verb | It's very easy ? just add the verb after the subject! | I wake up at 7:00 AM.) Tj
T*
(| We go to the beach in August. | They have dinner late. | You watch too much TV!) Tj
T*
(Slide 26: GRAMMAR ? | Present Simple: Negative Sentences ? | To say "No", add don't (do not)) Tj
T*
(before the verb! | Verb | don't | Subject | Put the subject first, then don't, then the verb.) Tj
T*
(Easy! | I don't wake up early on Friday. | We don't go to school in July. | They don't watch) Tj
T*
(TV every day.) Tj
T*
(Slide 27: GRAMMAR ? | Present Simple: Questions ? | To ask a question, start with Do! | Do |) Tj
T*
(Begin the question with Do | Verb + ? | Main verb followed by a question mark | Subject | I /) Tj
T*
(You / We / They | Start with Do, add the subject, then the verb! | ? Do you have breakfast in) Tj
T*
(the morning? | ? Yes, I do. / ? No, I don't. | ? Do they travel in December? | ? Yes, they do.) Tj
T*
